{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48893","headline":"过南城县麻姑山 三 · 崔橹","name":"过南城县麻姑山 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"差烟危碧半斜晖，何代仙人此羽飞。\n高袖镇长寒柏暗，古祠时复彩云归。\n红尘鞭马颜将换，碧落骖鸾意有违。\n声利系身家系念，今生辜负六铢衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}